          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "harem kana wari maw natu pakaetiman ni valri na ma’inay, zi kazuwan na trau na zuwa.",
          "chineseText": "今天是哥哥的婚禮，所以有很多人來。",
